{"sections":[{"slug":"丰沛线丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"丰沛线丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">丰沛线丛</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"丰沛线丛"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">丰沛性是代数几何中的一种</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">正性</span>”. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">理解代数簇</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的丰沛丛与理解</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathbb P^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入方式有关</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $L$ <span lang=\"zh\">为概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", $f\\in\\Gamma(X,L)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为整体截面</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的主开集为</span> $X_f := \\{x\\in X \\mid f_x \\notin \\mathfrak m_x L_x\\}$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $L$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足如下等价条件</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">丰沛</span></strong>:</p>\n<p>(a) <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">取遍</span> $\\Gamma(X,L^{\\otimes n})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素时</span>, $X_f$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拓扑基</span>;</p>\n<p>(a’) <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">取遍</span> $\\Gamma(X,L^{\\otimes n})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素中使</span> $X_f$ <span lang=\"zh\">仿射者时</span>, $X_f$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的覆盖</span>;</p>\n<p>(a’’) <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">取遍</span> $\\Gamma(X,L^{\\otimes n})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素中使</span> $X_f$ <span lang=\"zh\">仿射者时</span>, $X_f$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拓扑基</span>;</p>\n<p>…</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极丰沛线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极丰沛线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}